{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, \"sans-serif\", \"microsoft jhenghei\";'>天文台：高溫觸發的雷雨正影響本港。預料未來數小時本港部分地區雨勢較大及有狂風雷暴。市民請提高警惕。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-17T04:19:43.665692+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":49,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}